   "html": "<p>Universal tapped IHC to create two memorable photo moments at their Fast X trailer premiere event. At the end of each Fast film, the beloved family reunites in Dom's backyard, marking a moment of connection and celebration after their challenging adventures. IHC paid homage to this iconic scene, recreating the setting to allow fans the opportunity to join the gathering.</p>\n<p>Additionally, we allowed fans to become a part of the trailer themselves with our Continous Cars video opp. IHC supported Lost Legion in bringing this photo moment to hundreds of Fast &amp; Furious fans at the event. </p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "FAMILY COOKOUT PHOTO",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>A combined practical set and green screen video booth provided a chance for fans to create a sharable video on one side and capture pictures with their friends on the other. Hundreds of fans participated, including the film’s director himself!</p>"
